    "Content": "<p>In late-August 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Faka.ms%2Fsqlrestga&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cv-mamendonca%40microsoft.com%7Cb76cf259c3a64849b93a08dba3523302%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638283345700863041%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=RC7VaZXheL21hPnta71K5UozRfqij%2FqgdIiz76sA3no%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">External REST endpoint invocation is now GA</a>. &nbsp;Seamlessly integrate <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fsql%2Frelational-databases%2Fsystem-stored-procedures%2Fsp-invoke-external-rest-endpoint-transact-sql%3Fview%3Dazuresqldb-current%26tabs%3Drequest-headers%23allowed-endpoints&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cv-mamendonca%40microsoft.com%7Cb76cf259c3a64849b93a08dba3523302%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638283345700863041%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=d423PdTkc8UBTiw0aGPgWW9Xq5fgipdLVrqkop3s81Q%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Services</a> (Functions, OpenAI, PowerBI, and more) directly from an Azure SQL Database with <a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flearn.microsoft.com%2Fsql%2Frelational-databases%2Fsystem-stored-procedures%2Fsp-invoke-external-rest-endpoint-transact-sql%3Fview%3Dazuresqldb-current&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cv-mamendonca%40microsoft.com%7Cb76cf259c3a64849b93a08dba3523302%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638283345700863041%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=J00ZCKsHO5bmXIteKXUHR0ykDpJQJXP7y90qaRz9k1E%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">External REST endpoint invocation</a>. A simple line of code puts the power of Azure directly inside your Azure SQL Database.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "In late-August 2023, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL:\n\nExternal REST endpoint invocation is now GA . Seamlessly integrate Azure Services (Functions, OpenAI, PowerBI, and more) directly from an Azure SQL Database with External REST endpoint invocation . A simple line of code puts the power of Azure directly inside your Azure SQL Database."
  },
